  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/08/IMG_2179.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(27 fotos) La vesprada d&#39;aquest diumenge, &uacute;ltim de les festes d&#39;agost, ha estat nomenada a l&#39;Ajuntament de Suera &Agrave;ngela Palanques Ramos futura reina de les festes, c&agrave;rrec que compartir&agrave; amb la seua germaneta Andrea, que va ser nomenada reina infantil el dia 10 d&#39;agost.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentreinafestessuera18/img_2128.jpg\" alt=\"img_2128\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentreinafestessuera18/img_2129.jpg\" alt=\"img_2129\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentreinafestessuera18/img_2130.jpg\" alt=\"img_2130\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentreinafestessuera18/img_2132.jpg\" alt=\"img_2132\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentreinafestessuera18/img_2134.jpg\" alt=\"img_2134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentreinafestessuera18/img_2135.jpg\" alt=\"img_2135\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentreinafestessuera18/img_2136.jpg\" alt=\"img_2136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentreinafestessuera18/img_2137.jpg\" alt=\"img_2137\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentreinafestessuera18/img_2139.jpg\" alt=\"img_21